  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CHA is a horticultural cooperative society that produce tomatoes on a perennial basis. This ADF project will enable CHA to improve its financial management systems, build the business and leadership skills of the management and board, and improve the quality of tomatoes they produce.</narrative>
